      "final_translation": "“呵呵呵……340号……\n　我已经不是Union的人了。\n　你也是一样吧。”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/131/dialogue/01.22/0013",
      "group_rank": 856,
      "source_ja": "「ユニオン？　何だそりゃ！？」",
      "source_text_sha256": "fd2cfefbc9bd64f79aff6da9adac22387d664e86f8280ec5ea8aba0f41fefdb1",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-131.json",
      "before": "“联盟？那是什么！？”",
      "final_translation": "“Union？那是什么！？”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/131/dialogue/01.22/0017",
      "group_rank": 856,
      "source_ja": "「その一団がユニオン…！\n　お前やエンジェル達は、その一員か！」",
      "source_text_sha256": "d786bd88e7117a3f98f1fbaf76d028d56710efe972e3dd50508e2d35824aa324",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-131.json",
      "before": "“那个团体就是联盟……！\n　你和安琪尔都是其中一员吗！”",
      "final_translation": "“那个团体就是Union……！\n　你和安琪尔都是其中一员吗！”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/131/dialogue/01.31/0016",
      "group_rank": 856,
      "source_ja": "「急がないとユニオンのリーダー、\n　１２号があなたを粛清に来ますよ」",
      "source_text_sha256": "a0f3d4a59d40f9f05526b3a3df60146167a1b740a902b0ff5202659240ff8398",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-131.json",
      "before": "“不快点的话，\n　联盟的领袖12号会来肃清你。”",
      "final_translation": "“不快点的话，\n　Union的领袖12号会来肃清你。”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/139/dialogue/02.03/0042",
      "group_rank": 856,
      "source_ja": "「私は…何をやっているんだろう…。\n　ユニオンにも戻れず、\n　こんな所で一人で…」",
      "source_text_sha256": "4b9db5cd3542756848a12bb85c0c1bd10ba375d883df2a6b499cd8834446242d",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-139.json",
      "before": "“我……到底在做什么……\n　回不了联合，一个人在这种地方……”",
      "final_translation": "“我……到底在做什么……\n　回不了Union，一个人在这种地方……”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/140/dialogue/01.08/0032",
      "group_rank": 856,
      "source_ja": "「ユニオンやシュバルツバルトは、\n　あれを見つけるために\n　下界をうろついていたようだ」",
      "source_text_sha256": "a9e474e9a6c8c4eeb181cfa9929672655c7a5c008f3dc5ee4bb815503a376676",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-140.json",
      "before": "“联盟和施瓦兹·瓦尔德似乎是\n　为了找到那本书而在下界徘徊”",
      "final_translation": "“Union和施瓦兹·瓦尔德似乎是\n　为了找到那本书而在下界徘徊”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/140/dialogue/01.15/0026",
      "group_rank": 856,
      "source_ja": "「ユニオンの人間か…？」",
      "source_text_sha256": "361a64d2a34e2926c15db3b7136be30745baf698d9982c845e940974f7e64ec5",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-140.json",
      "before": "“是联盟的人吗……？”",
      "final_translation": "“是Union的人吗……？”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/140/dialogue/01.15/0028",
      "group_rank": 856,
      "source_ja": "「私の名はヴェラ・ロンシュタット。\n　ユニオンのリーダーだった人間だ」",
      "source_text_sha256": "04e17a6695081b37d63bf5e8fc2780196cad530ac4e4d290e8f34844eca3e3d4",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-140.json",
      "before": "“我的名字是薇拉·隆施塔特。\n　曾是联盟领袖的人”",
      "final_translation": "“我的名字是薇拉·隆施塔特。\n　曾是Union领袖的人”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/140/dialogue/01.15/0030",
      "group_rank": 856,
      "source_ja": "「ユニオンは事実上、崩壊したよ」",
      "source_text_sha256": "f453fdac849fa8cd70099b2ba5115936ee892cd3f19e5163d11d8660eaeb597e",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-140.json",
      "before": "“联盟事实上已经崩溃了”",
      "final_translation": "“Union事实上已经崩溃了”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/117/dialogue/02.01/0103",
      "group_rank": 870,
      "source_ja": "「微妙にグサッときた！」",
      "source_text_sha256": "d8a0499cb2715828db408f9e2cfc46257269ce286e35fd7ed8708b9f194dad8e",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-117.json",
      "before": "“微妙地扎心了！”",
      "final_translation": "“这话怎么连我也给扎疼了！”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/130/dialogue/02.01/0098",
      "group_rank": 870,
      "source_ja": "「微妙にグサッときた！」",
      "source_text_sha256": "d8a0499cb2715828db408f9e2cfc46257269ce286e35fd7ed8708b9f194dad8e",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-130.json",
      "before": "“微妙地被刺中了！”",
      "final_translation": "“这话怎么连我也给扎疼了！”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/144/dialogue/01.53/0003",
      "group_rank": 1214,
      "source_ja": "「そのフラグを君達は折っちゃったんだよ」",
      "source_text_sha256": "4c51bfb7d7c82b38cc9ce630a74d8eafc60ede617a1165cc7d9ebe10ae274eed",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-144.json",
      "before": "“你们把那个旗标折断了。”",
      "final_translation": "“你们把那个flag给拔掉了呀。”"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/144/dialogue/01.62/0004",
      "group_rank": 1214,
      "source_ja": "「せっかくフラグを立てたんだ。\n　楽しませてくれよ、元祖ニュータイプ！」",
      "source_text_sha256": "a092b99b669ad12b8d4c9cd5e674b4727bc68b8e2248e13128d9d389893e7cea",
      "corpus_path": "corpus/zh/story-dialogue/stage-144.json",
      "before": "“好不容易立了旗标。\n　让我开心吧，元祖新人类！”",
      "final_translation": "“好不容易才立起这个flag。\n　可得让我尽兴啊，元祖新人类！”"
    },
